# ── Build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ~90 MB, regenerated by any build.
build/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/.gradle/
*.apk
*.aab

# ── Machine-specific ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# local.properties holds the absolute SDK path, which on this machine lives
# under the packaged app's redirected LocalCache directory and is correct
# nowhere else. Every developer generates their own.
android/local.properties
.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store

# ── Secrets and instance state ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing in this repo should ever contain the shared secret. It lives in the
# n8n credential, the Dataiku project variable, and device Settings.
#
# n8n workflow EXPORTS in particular: they embed `pinData` from manual
# executions, which has twice carried something it should not - a real
# attendance record, and the X-ZK-Secret header in clear text. The generators
# (build-workflow.mjs, build-roster-workflow.mjs) are the source of truth;
# an export is a debugging snapshot and goes stale immediately.
*.export.json
current-workflow.export.json
.env
*.p8
*.pem
*.key

# ── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Node / logs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
*.log

# ── Deliberately NOT ignored, so nobody "tidies" them away ─────────────────
# android/jniLibs/            8.3 MB of vendor .so files, extracted from the
#                             device's own demo app. The build fails without
#                             them and they are not downloadable - see
#                             android/SDK-CONTRACT.md for provenance.
# android/app/libs/           the extracted zkteco-sdk.jar, same reasoning.
# android/app/schemas/        Room's exported schemas. These are the migration
#                             contract: without them a future schema change
#                             cannot be validated against what shipped.
# n8n/*.workflow.json         generated, but they are what you import into n8n,
#                             so keeping them means no build step to deploy.
